  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed gable end roof extension, by virtue of its form, siting, and increased bulk, would appear visually intrusive and overly dominant. It would remove the original hipped roof and disrupt the balanced roof form of the host dwelling and the semi detached pair it forms part of. The proposal would unreasonably impact on the character of the host dwelling and the local area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies D3 and D5 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD6, DMD8, DMD13 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
